Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you always calling\Non me to help, Antistella.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.17,0:00:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you again soon, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.99,0:00:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work today, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thanks to you, we'll have no problem\Nsticking to the schedule this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, glad to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.03,0:00:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.59,0:01:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone! Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.45,0:01:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's... huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.27,0:01:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm on a cloud, I'll fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.79,0:01:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fly. There's nothing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.51,0:02:53.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(294.4,295.2)}Northwest Clays Kingdom (15 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, drink up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.67,0:03:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But be careful, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's perfect. Thank you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to feed the goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take them to the\Npasture over by the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noor, now please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't go any further than the big rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.69,0:03:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get a wild rabbit and\Nsome nuts and seeds later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.69,0:03:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll boil you some more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.09,0:03:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I can't do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, Noor, live the\Nlife you wish to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soup's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.47,0:05:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nor, it's time for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's tonight's story?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's an adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, son, this one, with\Nthe help of his friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:06:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slayed a gigantic dragon and learned\Nmagic spells from an old sorcerer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,broke a curse upon a forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.81,0:06:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even got a magic elixir\Nfrom the king of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.49,0:06:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an adventurer will raise their sword and\Nstrike down evil for those who cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall I start reading it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.99,0:06:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, read it, read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, now settle in and\Nget ready for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.19,0:06:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, Norm, live\Nthe life you wish to lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.55,0:06:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat it all at once, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.05,0:06:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, Mom, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving town for the first time ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To become an adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.27,0:07:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just off the main road. Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place isn't for kids\Nto be hanging around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.59,0:08:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guards at the gate said I could be\Nan adventurer if I came to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your parents are probably worried sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No parents, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to hear that,\Nkid Well, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.37,0:08:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nor Okay, nor,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's see I take it you're heading\Nto the training academy for classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:09:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've ever had\Na kid your age try to do it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those registering with the Royal Capitals
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adventures Guild must\Ntake lessons beforehand,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.77,0:09:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meaning you basically get\Ntraining for your job class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to be an adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.29,0:09:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to have some skills first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.57,0:09:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the art of combat\Nor magic, stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.43,0:09:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heroes and storybooks can slay a dragon\Nas big as a mountain in a single swing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.81,0:09:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.97,0:10:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Noor, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, just give me some time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.11,0:10:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.03,0:10:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going further would be a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.75,0:10:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing you've retained at\Nall is parrying to evade an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it would be wiser if\Nyou were to choose another path.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.75,0:10:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.67,0:10:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your talent may be found\Nin another capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.47,0:10:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While fighting with any weapon imaginable,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you risk your life and become\Na shield for your allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.47,0:10:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty close to an adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.21,0:10:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I acknowledge your efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but what you have\Nacquired is only a slight
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,improvement of your\Nnatural physical abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you force yourself to continue on,\Nyou could very well lose your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.65,0:10:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.47,0:11:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, you lack the prudence to\Nhandle any sort of delicate weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are unable to dismantle the trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.97,0:11:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nor can you sense anyone's presence,\Nso you cannot become a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.01,0:11:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think you've come this far, yet\Nall you can manage is tiny flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's extremely rare to see someone as\Nincapable of magic as you seem to be, Norn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cleric?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.85,0:11:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it only works on minor scratches,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's still impressive you\Nbecame able to use low
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-level healing magic\Nwithout a natural blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.73,0:11:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't learn one decent skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spent a full\Nthree-month term practicing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at every training school\Nand you didn't pass one? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.29,0:12:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't let you\Nregister as an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.87,0:12:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad? Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.51,0:12:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turns out I have no\Ntalent for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.79,0:12:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must take what I've learned and\Ntrain harder than I ever have before!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.73,0:12:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My swordsman instructor told me, if\Nyou practice one skill repeatedly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over and over, you may be able\Nto master another skill! Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my skill that I acquired\Nin the swordsman class training.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will train!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:12:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morning, noon, and night!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.75,0:13:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can repel ten swords in one go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.05,0:13:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any new skills\Nyet, but I am getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.69,0:13:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a hundred swords in one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.83,0:13:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I still haven't\Nacquired any new skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.93,0:13:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, becoming an\Nadventurer is nothing but a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.77,0:14:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must keep training.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These past 14 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have trained every single day, and I\Ncan now parry a thousand wooden swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, still no worthy skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.61,0:14:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry, physical enhancement, feather\Nstep, tiny small flame, low heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, are you sure this is\Neverything that you have to offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.91,0:15:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you may be aware of the Royal\NCapital's class training school system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can take lessons from any of\Nour distinguished instructors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.37,0:15:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already been through all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.91,0:15:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, well, if that's the case, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.97,0:15:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't register with your guild, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry, but I re...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you don't need to apologize at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.07,0:15:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what I can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind not picking on my new employee?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.79,0:15:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just started. I'm fine. Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have absolutely no idea who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.47,0:15:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.65,0:15:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you mean you've been keeping up with\Nyour own solo training this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.49,0:15:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but in the end, I've really\Nonly been able to improve my parrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:15:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are different ranks of adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S-rank being the highest,\Nand E-rank being the lowest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be recognized as an E-rank, you've\Ngot to have one or more useful skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.71,0:16:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you, you don't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything but just give up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, that does not mean\Nyou can't be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.85,0:16:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's actually something\Nlower than E-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.39,0:16:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.31,0:16:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The F-Rank, which is basically not talked\Nabout, even for the people doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then I can register for that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're forbidden from taking\Nany quests that involve
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.31,0:16:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killing anything or venturing\Nout to gather items.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.37,0:16:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you can accept are\Nmiscellaneous tasks around the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But nobody's dumb enough\Nto go to the trouble of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,becoming an adventurer\Njust for running errands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, we also take a cut\Nfor the job placement fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, it used to be a job\Nfor beggars and vagabonds, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did hear what I just said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:16:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.65,0:17:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me take it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.07,0:17:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, Noor, here's your\NF-Rink adventurer license.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.81,0:17:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.37,0:17:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.65,0:17:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strength Enhancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.35,0:17:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feather Step.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was scary, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Low Healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiny flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.97,0:17:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stone throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dream of becoming an adventurer and\Nbeing useful has finally come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything beyond this\Nis more than I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you again soon, Norf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work today, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.51,0:18:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thanks to you, we'll have no problem\Nsticking to the schedule this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.57,0:19:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.71,0:19:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only seen these things in books.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought they\Nwere actually this big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surround it and block its movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let him get distracted!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all going to get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stone throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.31,0:20:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.93,0:21:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.49,0:21:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much force!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.23,0:21:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One blow from that and I'm dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.33,0:21:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need an opening to counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.45,0:21:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, even if there was one,\NI have no attack skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.73,0:21:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.97,0:21:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's still there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.17,0:21:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Featherstep!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.45,0:21:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I cannot become\Na true adventurer hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.35,0:21:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must at least be able to\Nprotect this frightened girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.05,0:21:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter the situation, an\Nadventurer will raise their sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.15,0:21:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and strike down evil for those who cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.85,0:21:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, son,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.49,0:22:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that is an adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.59,0:22:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.77,0:22:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would definitely have died\Nif that went on any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.07,0:22:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I thought I could travel the\Nworld and go on adventures at this level.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.07,0:22:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.97,0:22:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.49,0:22:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only alive because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.43,0:22:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.87,0:22:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it's too bad about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.79,0:22:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, sir, may I please have your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.29,0:22:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not anyone important.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.71,0:22:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.47,0:22:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm quite safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.89,0:23:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.73,0:23:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a cow like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was enormous, and so angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.49,0:23:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's clear now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have much more training to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.05,0:24:33.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.45,0:24:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.85,0:24:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.37,0:24:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.39,0:24:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.31,0:24:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.83,0:25:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.

